  m_text: "Cave Johnson here.\n\nIf you\xB4re reading this, CONGRATULATIONS on being promoted from scientist to lab rat. As you probably know the eggheads have been cooking up some serum for reviving people. We also found some material that only lets you pass when dead. Incredible! Soo we have locked you up in some spare test chambers, gave you an injector with an instant kill fluid and we threw some ampules there. Good luck.\n\nCave Johnson we\xB4re done here."
